 "background": [
  {
   "text": "Most likely cause: obstruction of pitot and/or static probes; probes rarely clog identically, so the first sign is usually a discrepancy between CAPT PFD, F/O PFD and STBY.",
   "applies_to": [
    "all"
   ],
   "refs": [
    {
     "book": "FCTM",
     "code": "PR-AEP-NAV",
     "page": "P 2/20",
     "pdf": 479
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Systems vote across three ADRs; two consistent but wrong ADRs can out-vote the correct one (e.g. two pitots blocked the same way).",
   "applies_to": [
    "all"
   ],
   "refs": [
    {
     "book": "FCTM",
     "code": "PR-AEP-NAV",
     "page": "P 2/20",
     "pdf": 479
    },
    {
     "book": "FCTM",
     "code": "PR-AEP-NAV",
     "page": "P 3/20",
     "pdf": 480
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Above FL 250 unreliable speed is mostly temporary (water/ice) and clears in minutes; at low altitude it is mostly permanent.",
   "applies_to": [
    "all"
   ],
   "refs": [
    {
     "book": "FCTM",
     "code": "PR-AEP-NAV",
     "page": "P 4/20",
     "pdf": 481
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Erroneous barometric altitude affects FPV, V/S and the transponder — advise ATC.",
   "applies_to": [
    "all"
   ],
   "refs": [
    {
     "book": "FCTM",
     "code": "PR-AEP-NAV",
     "page": "P 4/20",
     "pdf": 481
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
 "technique": [
  {
   "text": "Two objectives: fly the aircraft, then identify and isolate the affected ADR(s).",
   "applies_to": [
    "all"
   ],
   "refs": [
    {
     "book": "FCTM",
     "code": "PR-AEP-NAV",
     "page": "P 14/20",
     "pdf": 491
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Apply the memory items when in doubt about flying safely in the short term with current parameters.",
   "applies_to": [
    "all"
   ],
   "refs": [
    {
     "book": "FCTM",
     "code": "PR-AEP-NAV",
     "page": "P 16/20",
     "pdf": 493
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Rely on the STALL warning — it is AOA-based and not affected by erroneous airspeed.",
   "applies_to": [
    "all"
   ],
   "refs": [
    {
     "book": "FCTM",
     "code": "PR-AEP-NAV",
     "page": "P 15/20",
     "pdf": 492
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not instinctively reject an outlier ADR: two or even three ADRs can give identical but erroneous data.",
   "applies_to": [
    "all"
   ],
   "refs": [
    {
     "book": "FCTM",
     "code": "PR-AEP-NAV",
     "page": "P 17–18/20",
     "pdf": 494
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Change one parameter at a time (speed, altitude or configuration); GPS altitude is on the MCDU GPS MONITOR page.",
   "applies_to": [
    "all"
   ],
   "refs": [
    {
     "book": "FCTM",
     "code": "PR-AEP-NAV",
     "page": "P 17–18/20",
